{"resource":{"id":"rust-quick-revision-notes","title":"Rust — Quick Revision Notes","category":"Programming","difficulty":"Beginner","readingTime":"9 min","pages":6,"lastUpdated":"May 2026","tags":["Programming","Rust","Systems"],"heroImage":"https://images.unsplash.com/photo-1461749280684-dccba630e2f6?w=1800&q=80","heroSubtitle":"Condensed Rust revision — key concepts, mnemonics, comparison tables, and last-minute interview reminders."},"toc":[{"id":"objectives","label":"Learning Objectives"},{"id":"s1","label":"1. Ownership at a Glance"},{"id":"s2","label":"2. Borrow Rules Mnemonic"},{"id":"s3","label":"3. Smart Pointers Table"},{"id":"s4","label":"4. Error Handling"},{"id":"s5","label":"5. Traits Quick Recall"},{"id":"s6","label":"6. Concurrency Cheats"},{"id":"s7","label":"7. Async Essentials"},{"id":"s8","label":"8. Cargo Commands"},{"id":"s9","label":"9. Interview Reminders"},{"id":"summary","label":"Summary"},{"id":"faqs","label":"FAQ"},{"id":"glossary","label":"Glossary"},{"id":"references","label":"References"},{"id":"disclaimer","label":"Disclaimer"}],"related":[{"title":"Rust — Cheat Sheet","tag":"Programming","time":"5 min"},{"title":"Rust — Interview Questions","tag":"Programming","time":"35 min"},{"title":"Rust — PDF Notes","tag":"Programming","time":"69 min"}],"html":"<section id=\"objectives\" class=\"scroll-mt-24 pt-10\"><h2 class=\"text-2xl font-bold tracking-tight sm:text-3xl\">Learning Objectives</h2><div class=\"mt-4 space-y-4 text-foreground/90\">\n        <ul class=\"list-disc space-y-1 pl-5\">\n          <li>Reload core Rust in under 10 minutes.</li>\n          <li>Nail interview trivia with memorable mnemonics.</li>\n        </ul>\n      </div></section>\n\n      <section id=\"s1\" class=\"scroll-mt-24 pt-10\"><h2 class=\"text-2xl font-bold tracking-tight sm:text-3xl\">1. Ownership at a Glance</h2><div class=\"mt-4 space-y-4 text-foreground/90\">\n        <p><strong>MSD:</strong> Move · Scope · Drop. One owner, moves on assignment, drops at scope end.</p>\n        <Figure src=\"https://images.unsplash.com/photo-1451187580459-43490279c0fa?w=1400&q=80\" caption=\"Figure 1 — Ownership timeline: bind → move/borrow → drop.\" />\n      </div></section>\n\n      <section id=\"s2\" class=\"scroll-mt-24 pt-10\"><h2 class=\"text-2xl font-bold tracking-tight sm:text-3xl\">2. Borrow Rules — &#x27;AXM&#x27;</h2><div class=\"mt-4 space-y-4 text-foreground/90\">\n        <p><strong>A</strong>liasing <strong>X</strong>OR <strong>M</strong>utation. Many <code>&amp;T</code> or one <code>&amp;mut T</code>, never both.</p>\n      </div></section>\n\n      <section id=\"s3\" class=\"scroll-mt-24 pt-10\"><h2 class=\"text-2xl font-bold tracking-tight sm:text-3xl\">3. Smart Pointers Table</h2><div class=\"mt-4 space-y-4 text-foreground/90\">\n        <table class=\"w-full border-collapse text-sm\">\n          <thead><tr class=\"border-b\"><th class=\"p-2 text-left\">Type</th><th class=\"p-2 text-left\">Owner</th><th class=\"p-2 text-left\">Thread</th></tr></thead>\n          <tbody>\n            <tr class=\"border-b\"><td class=\"p-2\">Box</td><td class=\"p-2\">Single</td><td class=\"p-2\">–</td></tr>\n            <tr class=\"border-b\"><td class=\"p-2\">Rc</td><td class=\"p-2\">Multi</td><td class=\"p-2\">Single-thread</td></tr>\n            <tr class=\"border-b\"><td class=\"p-2\">Arc</td><td class=\"p-2\">Multi</td><td class=\"p-2\">Multi-thread</td></tr>\n            <tr><td class=\"p-2\">RefCell</td><td class=\"p-2\">Interior mut</td><td class=\"p-2\">Single-thread</td></tr>\n          </tbody>\n        </table>\n      </div></section>\n\n      <section id=\"s4\" class=\"scroll-mt-24 pt-10\"><h2 class=\"text-2xl font-bold tracking-tight sm:text-3xl\">4. Error Handling</h2><div class=\"mt-4 space-y-4 text-foreground/90\">\n        <p><code>Result&lt;T,E&gt;</code> + <code>?</code>. Libs → <code>thiserror</code>. Apps → <code>anyhow</code>.</p>\n      </div></section>\n\n      <section id=\"s5\" class=\"scroll-mt-24 pt-10\"><h2 class=\"text-2xl font-bold tracking-tight sm:text-3xl\">5. Traits Quick Recall</h2><div class=\"mt-4 space-y-4 text-foreground/90\">\n        <p>Static dispatch = fast, bloated. Dynamic (<code>dyn</code>) = flexible, one vtable indirection.</p>\n      </div></section>\n\n      <section id=\"s6\" class=\"scroll-mt-24 pt-10\"><h2 class=\"text-2xl font-bold tracking-tight sm:text-3xl\">6. Concurrency Cheats</h2><div class=\"mt-4 space-y-4 text-foreground/90\">\n        <p><strong>SAM</strong>: Send-safe, Arc-shared, Mutex-guarded. Prefer channels for ownership transfer.</p>\n        <Figure src=\"https://images.unsplash.com/photo-1544197150-b99a580bb7a8?w=1400&q=80\" caption=\"Figure 2 — Concurrency triangle: threads ↔ channels ↔ shared state.\" />\n      </div></section>\n\n      <section id=\"s7\" class=\"scroll-mt-24 pt-10\"><h2 class=\"text-2xl font-bold tracking-tight sm:text-3xl\">7. Async Essentials</h2><div class=\"mt-4 space-y-4 text-foreground/90\">\n        <p>Futures are lazy — <code>.await</code> or spawn. Tokio for the runtime.</p>\n      </div></section>\n\n      <section id=\"s8\" class=\"scroll-mt-24 pt-10\"><h2 class=\"text-2xl font-bold tracking-tight sm:text-3xl\">8. Cargo Commands</h2><div class=\"mt-4 space-y-4 text-foreground/90\">\n        <div class=\"my-3 overflow-hidden rounded-2xl border border-border/60 bg-slate-950 text-slate-100 shadow-sm\"><div class=\"flex items-center justify-between border-b border-white/10 px-4 py-2 text-xs text-slate-400\"><span>code</span></div><pre class=\"overflow-x-auto p-4 text-[13px] leading-relaxed\"><code>cargo new / build / run / test / bench / doc / clippy / fmt / add / update</code></pre></div>\n      </div></section>\n\n      <section id=\"s9\" class=\"scroll-mt-24 pt-10\"><h2 class=\"text-2xl font-bold tracking-tight sm:text-3xl\">9. Interview Reminders</h2><div class=\"mt-4 space-y-4 text-foreground/90\">\n        <ul class=\"list-disc space-y-1 pl-5\">\n          <li>Explain the borrow checker in 60 s.</li>\n          <li>Compare Rc vs Arc, Mutex vs RwLock.</li>\n          <li>Show a lifetime annotation with reason.</li>\n          <li>Panic vs Result: recoverable vs invariant violation.</li>\n        </ul>\n        <div class=\"my-4 rounded-2xl border-l-4 border-sky-500/40 bg-sky-500/10 text-sky-900 dark:text-sky-100 p-4\"><div class=\"flex items-start gap-3\"><div class=\"mt-0.5 shrink-0\"><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"20\" height=\"20\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" class=\"h-5 w-5\"><circle cx=\"12\" cy=\"12\" r=\"10\"/><path d=\"M12 16v-4\"/><path d=\"M12 8h.01\"/></svg></div><div class=\"min-w-0 flex-1\"><p class=\"text-sm font-semibold\">Interviewer favourite</p><div class=\"mt-1 text-sm\">\"When would you reach for unsafe?\"</div></div></div></div>\n      </div></section>\n\n      <section id=\"summary\" class=\"scroll-mt-24 pt-10\"><h2 class=\"text-2xl font-bold tracking-tight sm:text-3xl\">Summary &amp; Key Takeaways</h2><div class=\"mt-4 space-y-4 text-foreground/90\">\n        <p>Six pages, one framework: ownership, borrowing, traits, error, concurrency, async.</p>\n      </div></section>\n\n      <section id=\"faqs\" class=\"scroll-mt-24 pt-10\"><h2 class=\"text-2xl font-bold tracking-tight sm:text-3xl\">FAQ</h2><div class=\"mt-4 space-y-4 text-foreground/90\">\n        <details class=\"group my-2 rounded-2xl border border-border/60 bg-card p-4 open:shadow-sm\"><summary class=\"flex cursor-pointer list-none items-center justify-between gap-4 text-sm font-semibold\"><span>Enough for interviews?</span><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"16\" height=\"16\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" class=\"h-4 w-4 shrink-0 transition group-open:rotate-90\"><path d=\"m9 18 6-6-6-6\"/></svg></summary><div class=\"mt-3 text-sm text-muted-foreground\">Combine with the Interview Questions handbook and Practice workbook.</div></details>\n      </div></section>\n\n      <section id=\"glossary\" class=\"scroll-mt-24 pt-10\"><h2 class=\"text-2xl font-bold tracking-tight sm:text-3xl\">Glossary</h2><div class=\"mt-4 space-y-4 text-foreground/90\">\n        <ul class=\"list-disc space-y-1 pl-5\">\n          <li><strong>Send/Sync</strong> — marker traits for cross-thread safety.</li>\n          <li><strong>Vtable</strong> — dispatch table for dynamic trait calls.</li>\n        </ul>\n      </div></section>\n\n      <section id=\"references\" class=\"scroll-mt-24 pt-10\"><h2 class=\"text-2xl font-bold tracking-tight sm:text-3xl\">References</h2><div class=\"mt-4 space-y-4 text-foreground/90\"><References /></div></section>\n\n      <section id=\"disclaimer\" class=\"scroll-mt-24 pt-10\"><h2 class=\"text-2xl font-bold tracking-tight sm:text-3xl\">Disclaimer</h2><div class=\"mt-4 space-y-4 text-foreground/90\">\n        <p class=\"text-sm text-muted-foreground\">Revision aid — not a substitute for hands-on practice.</p>\n      </div></section>"}